phics","GeForce GTX 970 | R9 290X"],["DirectX","Version 11"],["Storage","4 GB available space"]],"rec":[["OS","Windows 10 x64"],["Processor","Intel Core i7- 7700k | Ryzen 5 3600"],["Memory","8 GB RAM"],["Graphics","GeForce GTX 980 | R9 390"],["DirectX","Version 11"],["Storage","4 GB available space"]],"deck":3,"blurb":"Dino Path Trail is set on an American frontier where dinosaurs survived and still roam. You set off on a long, dangerous trip across varied regions to rescue your sister, who has been kidnapped. Along the way you deal with hungry predators, outlaws and harsh weather, and you have to hunt and manage supplies to stay alive.\n\nIt is a single-player survival roguelike, so runs are tough and setbacks are part of the experience. Each attempt plays out a little differently. Dino Path Trail suits players who like survival challenges and frontier settings, and who enjoy the tension of trying to keep going with limited resources."}}